    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40618" root="نهد" body-key="n">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهد</span></b>  <i>He filled</i> a tank or cistern, (S, L,) and
a drinking-bowl, (A,) and a vessel, (L, K,) <i>so
that it overflowed:</i> (L:) or <i>nearly filled</i> it. (A,
L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ تُنْهِدُ الإِنَآءَ</span> <i>A she-camel that fills
the vessel</i> [with her milk]. (IAar, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهدهُ</span>
<i>He made him,</i> or <i>it, to rise.</i> (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See 1.

